---
import { DOWNLOAD_URL } from '../config';
import WindowsIcon from './WindowsIcon.astro';
---
<section class="cta-section">
  <div class="shell cta-inner">
    <span class="eyebrow">现在就开始</span>
    <h2>开始你的直播互动</h2>
    <p>下载十九直播，创建属于自己的直播互动玩法。</p>
    <a class="button button-primary download-address-button" href={DOWNLOAD_URL} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span class="download-address-button-inner"><WindowsIcon /><span>下载地址</span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span></a>
  </div>
</section>
